{"2870410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Henry's Forgotten Performance", "steam_appid": 2870410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/2d1b14b42984284442eec7540f8740d7.webp?t=1762715836\" width=259 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Henry's Forgotten Performance </strong>is a dark horror game about an abandoned corporation, a forgotten arcade machine, and choices that decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist infiltrates the sealed Freude Corp complex. There, he encounters Henry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A random activation of an old arcade machine traps him in a place where he is no longer the one setting the rules.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you escape, or stay trapped forever?</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/fa5d441ca69cf5b06363651dbc1bbe20.webp?t=1762715836\" width=259 height=54 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric abandoned corporate environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious adversary that changes throughout the story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Camcorder View</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870410/extras/2d1b14b42984284442eec7540f8740d7.webp?t=1762715836\" width=259 height=54 /></span